### Weekly Log
- **Week 1 (date):** Environment set up (Kali, QEMU, `make qemu` working). Repo
  cloned. Features assigned to members.

## 5. How to Build and Test
make qemu
Then run the feature's test program, e.g. `prioritytest`, `cowtest`, `symlinktest`.

